Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 08:42:23 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Sketch ownership: user_id on SketchEntity, per-user
 SketchController

- SketchEntity: @ManyToOne owner (user_id, NOT NULL), content stored as TEXT
- UserEntity: @OneToMany sketches (cascade, orphanRemoval)
- SketchRepository: findAllByUserIdOrderByUpdatedAtDesc, findByIdAndUserId
- SketchController: every endpoint scoped to the logged-in AuthUser,
  other users' sketches answer 404, responses are DTOs (no password hash),
  title is required, handlers public

